      "content": "The IAM policy you provided only grants permissions to `PutObject` and `GetBucketLocation` for objects within the bucket, not necessarily for the logging service itself to organize or manage the logs. Ensure the attached IAM role also has the necessary permissions for CloudWatch Logs to write to S3 if that is the direct log destination, as S3 access for logging services can be complex. Double-check that the ARN in the policy exactly matches your bucket name and that the Lambda execution role is attached to this policy.",
